node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Media IS committed, deliberately.
#
# Everything under public/media/ (brand logos, payment marks, site photography and the
# Instagram archive in public/media/ig/) is tracked on purpose.
#
# The whole point of this repository is that a deploy can be rolled back to an exact
# earlier state. A commit without the media is not a restorable state — it is source code
# that renders a site full of broken images.
#
# If the video library ever grows past ~100MB, move to Git LFS. Do NOT solve it by
# ignoring the assets, or rollback silently stops working.

